2026-10-11T04:34:34.2057965Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2158483Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2168992Z [0m
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2169429Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2170161Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2170511Z 
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2171296Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2172223Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2172712Z 
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2173178Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2173784Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2173958Z 
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2174417Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2174962Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2175406Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2176224Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2176388Z 
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2176613Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2176864Z 
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2177118Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2177705Z    can use Nix.
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2177825Z 
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2177947Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2178099Z 
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2178463Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2178948Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2181996Z 
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2182228Z I will:
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2182412Z 
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2182734Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2183304Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2183734Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2184122Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2184389Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2184660Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2185067Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2185428Z    /root
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2197929Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2198846Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2210243Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2210916Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2211201Z 
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2212089Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2212571Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
