2026-10-11T04:34:34.2243821Z 
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2244055Z   $ curl -L https://nixos.org/nix/install | sh
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2244299Z 
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2244560Z or maybe in a CI pipeline. Because of that, I'm going to skip the
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2244995Z verbose output in the interest of brevity.
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2245198Z 
2026-10-11T04:34:34.2245308Z If you would like to
